Parts of this package are ported from draw.io (https://github.com/jgraph/drawio),
Copyright (c) 2006-2026 JGraph Ltd, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(a copy is in stencils/LICENSE):

- the geometry of cells, edge routing, edge styles and perimeters (route.go,
  edgestyle.go, perimeter.go, view.go) from mxGraph's mxGraphView, mxGraph,
  mxEdgeStyle and mxPerimeter and draw.io's Graph.js and Shapes.js;
- the drawing of shapes, markers and stencils (canvas.go, shape*.go,
  marker*.go, edgeshapes.go, jumps.go, stencil*.go) from mxAbstractCanvas2D,
  mxSvgCanvas2D, mxShape and its subclasses, mxMarker, mxStencil and
  draw.io's Graph.js, Shapes.js and the shape libraries shapes/mxBasic.js,
  shapes/mxArrows.js, shapes/bpmn/mxBpmnShape2.js and shapes/mxAWS4.js;
- the placement of labels (label.go) from mxCellRenderer, mxText and
  mxSvgCanvas2D, and the default stylesheet (style.go) from styles/default.xml.

The code was translated from JavaScript to Go and adapted to write BDF
instructions instead of SVG. The embedded stencil libraries and their
additional terms are described in stencils/NOTICE.

The styles that shapes of older AWS icon sets are drawn with
(aws_legacy_table.go) are taken from the AWS palettes of draw.io's sidebar
(js/diagramly/sidebar/Sidebar-AWS*.js) by tools/gen-drawio-awsmap.
